== Trivia ==
* Marbles is based on [https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=948825958 this Steam Workshop item] by FoksMachine and Bustin Blotch.
* This item is used in {{chal|Pica Run}}.
* This item is a reference to how marbles and small toys are sometimes swallowed by children.

